  "body_excerpt": "Marketing Operations Analyst\nNomad HQ, New York CityMarketing Operations – Consulting Services /Hybrid\nSUBMIT YOUR APPLICATION\nResume/CV\n✱\nATTACH RESUME/CV\nFull name\n✱\nEmail\n✱\nPhone\n✱\nCurrent location\n✱\nCurrent company\nLINKS\nLinkedIn URL\nGitHub URL\nPortfolio URL\nNomad Marketing\nFOLLOWING SUBMISSION OF THIS APPLICATION, YOU MAY RECEIVE AN INVITATION TO A SECOND-ROUND VIDEO SCREENING THAT WILL BE REVIEWED BY BOTH THE CEO AND CHIEF PEOPLE OFFICER. WE TRULY CARE ABOUT YOUR RESEARCH INTO THIS ROLE AND YOUR THOUGHTFUL RESPONSES. AFTER RECEIVING THE VIDEO INTERVIEW INVITE, YOU WILL HAVE TWO DAYS TO COMPLETE IT.\nEveryone has a “mini superpower” that doesn’t usually make it onto a resume. What’s yours, and when has it really helped someone else?\n✱\nWhat’s a piece of feedback (from a teacher, manager, or friend) that really stuck with you? How did you receive it, and how does it show up in your perspective and how you work today?\n✱\nImagine you join our team and it’s your 6‑month mark. What do you hope your new teammates are saying about you when you’re not in the room?\n✱\nWhat attracted you to apply for this position?\n✱\nELIGIBILITY AND LOCATION\nAre you legally authorized to work in the United States?\n✱\nYes\nNo\nWill you now or in the future require sponsorship for employment visa status (e.g., H-1B or other employment-based immigration cases)?\n✱\nYes\nNo\nDo you live in or near NYC with an ability to commute into the office?\n✱\nYes\nNo\nNot currently, but I will by the time I would take this position\nSUBMIT APPLICATION\n\nNomad Marketing Home Page\n\nJobs powered by",
